{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54137","headline":"颂 一 · 利踪","name":"颂 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来住子（《祖堂集》卷十八作「紫」）湖，二时粥饭（《祖堂集》及《景德传灯录》卷十作「斋粥」）气力麤。\n无事上山走一转（《祖堂集》、《灯录》作「每日上山三五转」）。\n试（《五灯会元》卷四作「借」）问（《灯录》作「问汝」）时人（《祖堂集》作「回头问汝」）会也无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"利踪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}